WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.305 --> 00:00:01.680
FELIPE HOFFA:
Hello, data heroes.

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:04.040
I have a new data
challenge for you.

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:06.840
I'm Felipe Hoffa, a Google
Cloud developer advocate.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:09.780
And I'm here to tell you
about our BigQuery Challenge,

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:14.040
where every week, you can enter
to win $500 in Cloud Credits.

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:17.340
And all you need to know
is BigQuery and SQL.

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:19.760
You know that BigQuery
has many public data

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:22.530
sets ready for your
analysis and you don't even

00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:25.200
need a credit card to get
a free account with one

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:29.430
terabyte of free queries every
month, so let's have some fun.

00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:32.159
To participate in the
challenge, just go every week

00:00:32.159 --> 00:00:39.180
to goo.gle/bqchallenge
and find two SQL queries.

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:41.190
Run these two
queries in BigQuery

00:00:41.190 --> 00:00:44.250
and post the answers in
the participation form.

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:45.870
Every week, we'll
randomly choose

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:47.790
between the correct
entries, and you

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:51.270
might be the winner of
the $500 in Cloud Credits.

00:00:51.270 --> 00:00:57.210
So go to goo.gle/bqchallenge
and run the two queries you will

00:00:57.210 --> 00:00:58.080
find there.

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:01.110
And make sure to submit your
answers using the participation

00:01:01.110 --> 00:01:02.160
form.

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:05.800
Stay curious and join
the BigQuery Challenge.

